<h3>Quality-of-Life Improvements</h3>

<div>A new <strong>Activities UI</strong> provides a convenient overview of=
 all ongoing events. <strong>Victory Emotes</strong> allow players to mark =
kills with a visual flourish, while <strong>Twitch Drops </strong>are now a=
vailable to the community. <strong>Lost Equipment Loadouts</strong> give pl=
ayers an easy way to regear after death, facilitating a quick return to the=
 action. A new <strong>Journey Back </strong>ability helps cut down on long=
 travel times, <strong>Gathering Tomes</strong> offer additional gathering =
Fame, and <strong>Training Dummies</strong> are available on Player Islands=
 for combat practice.</div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

